# Unity generated solution / project files
**/*.csproj
**/*.unityproj
**/*.sln
**/*.suo
**/*.tmp
**/*.svd
**/*.pdb
**/*.mdb
**/*.opendb
**/*.VC.db

# Unity meta files for generated folders can be ignored if they exist
**/[Ll]ibrary.meta
**/[Tt]emp.meta
**/[Oo]bj.meta
**/[Bb]uild.meta
**/[Bb]uilds.meta
**/[Ll]ogs.meta
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings.meta

