# .NET / C# build outputs (outside Unity too)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg
**/*.cache
**/*.log

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / web
# ------------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/.vite/
